[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12376.229, "timestamp": "03:26:16", "text": "我是香农·凯里，这是你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12378.469, "timestamp": "03:26:18", "text": "晨曦子午线。我们现在就在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12382.87, "timestamp": "03:26:22", "text": "早上和瑞茜在一起。那是什么东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12385.75, "timestamp": "03:26:25", "text": "他是在做甜甜圈动作吗？搞什么鬼？到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12388.55, "timestamp": "03:26:28", "text": "到此一游。香农，一个正在做甜甜圈的NPC。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12390.55, "timestamp": "03:26:30", "text": "你好。重返银河市场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12392.309, "timestamp": "03:26:32", "text": "你做了一件很多人都会做的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12394.95, "timestamp": "03:26:34", "text": "十年前还认为这是不可能的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12397.51, "timestamp": "03:26:37", "text": "你成功的秘诀是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12399.14, "timestamp": "03:26:39", "text": "神秘的外星科技。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12401.79, "timestamp": "03:26:41", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12404.63, "timestamp": "03:26:44", "text": "山宁. Atlas之所以蓬勃发展，是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12406.95, "timestamp": "03:26:46", "text": "我们把它带向了一个新的方向。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12408.63, "timestamp": "03:26:48", "text": "认为公司应该提升其"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12410.55, "timestamp": "03:26:50", "text": "员工们扛在肩上，而不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12412.83, "timestamp": "03:26:52", "text": "反过来也一样。那你呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12415.429, "timestamp": "03:26:55", "text": "竞赛？ Atlas 一直吸引着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12417.59, "timestamp": "03:26:57", "text": "备受关注。你有没有过"}]